                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Twelfth Meeting of the Working Group Participating
                        in the Washington Exploratory Conversations on Security, August</hi> 18,
                    1948</p>
                <p>The twelfth meeting was devoted to discussion and suggested revision of draft
                    statements on the “Nature of North American Association with North Atlantic
                    Security Arrangements” and the “Outline of Provisions which Might be Suitable
                    for Inclusion in a North Atlantic Security Arrangement.” The unsigned memorandum
                    of this meeting is not printed (840.20/8–1848).</p>
            </div>
        </body>
